a, tudo isso para facilitar a ao máximo a vida de seus moradores. Agende uma Visita e descubra tudo o que este imóvel pode oferecer para você e sua família.\n(41) 99223-6006\nAs informações estão sujeitas a alterações. Consulte o corretor responsável.","fotos":["https://imagens.tecimob.com.br/media/bd45af7b-ad51-4cfc-92e9-98d81a11fe3f/properties/b750d6f8-b478-4669-b971-b93dec805030/images/40eef9a8-b549-4a35-99d4-bbc2c3083df31748893798kPuY.jpg","https://imagens.tecimob.com.br/media/bd45af7b-ad51-4cfc-92e9-98d81a11fe3f/properties/b750d6f8-b478-4669-b971-b93dec805030/images/05bae35b-4bc6-46c0-84b7-361f205914921748893788KVbu.jpg","https://imagens.tecimob.com.br/media/bd45af7b-ad51-4cfc-92e9-98d81a11fe3f/properties/b750d6f8-b478-4669-b971-b93dec805030/images/2b0132a3-8a9a-4032-ba3c-d2e97c5ff16217488937989aSy.jpg","https://imagens.tecimob.com.br/media/bd45af7b-ad51-4cfc-92e9-98d81a11fe3f/properties/b750d6f8-b478-4669-b971-b93dec805030/images/16f0295d-0f5c-460e-ad60-3029c3ef24231748893791JT4q.jpg","https://imagens.tecimob.com.br/media/bd45af7b-ad51-4cfc-92e9-98d81a11fe3f/properties/b750d6f8-b478-4669-b971-b93dec805030/images/b959bd43-0c48-4691-847d-534aff615ee81748893791wkXj.jpg","https://imagens.tecimob.com.br/media/bd45af7b-ad51-4cfc-92e9-98d81a11fe3f/properties/b750d6f8-b478-4669-b971-b93dec805030/images/de3e4e9c-83dc-4804-960b-8234d6f6f71f1748893788udHn.jpg","https://imagens.tecimob.com.br/media/bd45af7b-ad51-4cfc-92e9-98d81a11fe3f/properties/b750d6f8-b478-4669-b971-b93dec805030/images/5bc46a1b-a87e-413e-9bdc-d0e3b328d32a17488937888JIC.jpg","https://imagens.tecimob.com.br/media/bd45af7b-ad51-4cfc-92e9-98d81a11fe3f/properties/b750d6f8-b478-4669-b971-b93dec805030/images/35a422d2-185d-439c-84dc-54138f64e5a31748893791pRGo.jpg","https://imagens.tecimob.com.br/media/bd45af7b-ad51-4cfc-92e9-98d81a11fe3f/properties/b750d6f8-b478-4669-b971-b93dec805030/images/87a63f07-3878-434e-8ab1-a0276a7990031748893788YnhW.jpg","https://imagens.tecimob.com.br/media/bd45af7b-ad51-4cfc-92e9-98